# Response headers for the static asset responses of the production SPA
# (apps/web is deployed as a Cloudflare Workers asset bundle; the `_headers`
# file is applied by the platform to every asset response, while `/api/*`
# responses come from the Worker itself and already carry their own).
#
# The application ships no inline <script> (Vite emits external module
# scripts) and self-hosts its fonts and icons, so the CSP below needs no
# remote source. `style-src 'unsafe-inline'` stays because React writes
# inline style attributes; no inline <style> or remote stylesheet is used.
# `connect-src 'self'` is the same-origin control plane API.
#
# See docs/adr/0010-worker-static-assets-production.md for the asset
# deployment shape.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
